/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Designed and executed a Pizza Sales Analysis project using SQL to uncover key business insights and support data-driven decisions. Analyzed sales data by performing complex queries involving multiple joins, aggregations, subqueries, and window functions. Calculated category-wise revenue contribution, total sales, and order frequency while identifying top-selling pizza types and seasonal demand patterns. Ensured data accuracy and optimized query performance for efficient analysis. Delivered a detailed report on revenue trends and customer preferences, providing valuable recommendations for inventory and marketing strategies.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
